# Source: udit-001/india-maps-data (MIT). Districts polygon set with st_nm
# matching India 2020+ administrative boundaries (Ladakh separate, J&K reduced,
# DH merged UT, Telangana split). We dissolve districts -> states by st_nm,
# stamp canonical ISO 3166-2:IN codes, and simplify with mapshaper.
